@startuml
 title Целевая слоистая архитектура Request System
 top to bottom direction

 note top
   Это целевая схема учебного проекта; функции пока не реализованы.
   Стрелки сплошной линией показывают вызовы во время выполнения.
   Штриховая реализация показывает зависимость кода адаптера от порта.
 end note

 package "1. Presentation / Controller" as presentation {
   component "CLI / UI adapters" as ui
   component "Request controller" as controller <<planned>>
 }

 package "2. Service" as services {
   component "Request use cases\n(validation, assignment, status workflow)" as request_service <<planned>>
   component "User / category use cases\n(only when required by scenarios)" as supporting_services <<planned>>
   component "Domain concepts\nUser, Request, Status, Category, Comment" as domain <<planned>>
 }

 package "3. Repository contracts" as repositories {
   interface "RequestRepository\n(requests, status history, comments)" as request_port
   interface "UserRepository" as user_port
   interface "CategoryRepository" as category_port
 }

 package "4. Infrastructure" as infrastructure {
   component "Persistence adapter\n(technology TBD)" as adapter <<planned>>
   database "Database\n(technology TBD)" as database <<planned>>
 }

 ui --> controller : input
 controller --> request_service : invoke
 request_service --> request_port : calls port
 request_service ..> domain : uses
 supporting_services ..> user_port : when needed
 supporting_services ..> category_port : when needed
 adapter ..|> request_port : implements
 adapter ..|> user_port : implements
 adapter ..|> category_port : implements
 adapter --> database : reads / writes

 note bottom of request_port
   Compile-time dependency points inward:
   infrastructure implements repository contracts.
   Runtime calls are delegated to the configured adapter.
 end note
@enduml
